:"Kayjnr10","author_id":"188710604","text":"What is HMPV?\nHuman Metapneumovirus (HMPV) is a viral infection that causes upper respiratory tract infections, such as colds, and serious lung infections like bronchitis and pneumonia ¹. https://t.co/d5M9UHNAe2","in_corpus":true,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":35,"subtree_size":15,"dt_root_h":0.006,"parent_id":"1875532875292144080","conversation_id":"1875532875292144080"},{"id":"1875533597299405268","x":0.004938,"y":2.0,"t":1735997029,"iso":"2025-01-04T13:23:49Z","rt":6,"replies":3,"quotes":1,"likes":12,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"Kayjnr10","author_id":"188710604","text":"Now, the current situation in China.\nThere's been a rise in HMPV cases among children in China, with the virus becoming one of the top four most common viral infections among hospital visitors ¹. The China CDC has reported an increase in HMPV cases, particularly among children https://t.co/nitrln2CiO","in_corpus":true,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":29,"subtree_size":14,"dt_root_h":0.048,"parent_id":"1875532960197439525","conversation_id":"1875532875292144080"},{"id":"1875534789639586259","x":0.013119,"y":4.0,"t":1735997314,"iso":"2025-01-04T13:28:34.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"KKyini","author_id":"1349400208568938499","text":"@Kayjnr10 They should keep it in China","in_corpus":false,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.127,"parent_id":"1875533597299405268","conversation_id":"1875532875292144080"},{"id":"1875534154047402356","x":0.008756,"y":2.0,"t":1735997162,"iso":"2025-01-04T13:26:02Z","rt":4,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":7,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"Kayjnr10","author_id":"188710604","text":"Symptoms and Transmission\nHMPV symptoms include cough, fever, runny nose, and shortness of breath. The virus is spread through respiratory droplets, contact with contaminated surfaces, and close contact with infected individuals [1). https://t.co/UHgp6z4rmq","in_corpus":true,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":23,"subtree_size":11,"dt_root_h":0.085,"parent_id":"1875533597299405268","conversation_id":"1875532875292144080"},{"id":"1875534530821714175","x":0.011339,"y":2.0,"t":1735997252,"iso":"2025-01-04T13:27:32Z","rt":4,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":6,"relation":"reply","niveau":4,"author":"Kayjnr10","author_id":"188710604","text":"Who can the virus affect? \nThe virus is capable of affecting young children, the elderly, and people with compromised immune systems are most vulnerable to severe HMPV symptoms ¹. https://t.co/NCAEftAETz","in_corpus":true,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":19,"subtree_size":10,"dt_root_h":0.11,"parent_id":"1875534154047402356","conversation_id":"1875532875292144080"},{"id":"1875535193085264318","x":0.015875,"y":2.0,"t":1735997410,"iso":"2025-01-04T13:30:10Z","rt":7,"replies":4,"quotes":0,"likes":8,"relation":"reply","niveau":5,"author":"Kayjnr10","author_id":"188710604","text":"How do we protect ourselves from this possible virus?🦠\n\nPrevention and Treatment\nThere's no specific vaccine or antiviral treatment for HMPV. However, supportive treatment can help alleviate symptoms. Preventive measures include:\n\n- Frequent Handwashing- Regularly wash hands https://t.co/TDzDb343u4","in_corpus":true,"depth":5,"subtree_rt":15,"subtree_size":9,"dt_root_h":0.154,"parent_id":"1875534530821714175","conversation_id":"1875532875292144080"},{"id":"1875540162601742783","x":0.049892,"y":3.0,"t":1735998595,"iso":"2025-01-04T13:49:55.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":6,"author":"1tymeChampion","author_id":"1820520423018106880","text":"@Kayjnr10 Thank you very much on this awareness 🫂","in_corpus":false,"depth":6,"subtree_rt":1,"subtree_size":2,"dt_root_h":0.483,"parent_id":"1875535193085264318","conversation_id":"1875532875292144080"},{"id":"1875542761178591486","x":0.067662,"y":3.0,"t":1735999214,"iso":"2025-01-04T14:00:14.000Z","rt":1,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":7,"author":"Ka